    <enums name="XrSpatialReferenceImageFormatEXT" type="enum">
        <enum value="1"   name="XR_SPATIAL_REFERENCE_IMAGE_FORMAT_RGBA_8888_EXT"   comment="An RGBA buffer. The format makes no guarantees regarding the layout of the pixel data in memory. The pixels must: be accessed using the metadata provided by the corresponding slink:XrSpatialReferenceImagePlaneEXT structures. Each pixel color channel has an 8 bit size, making each pixel 32 bit in size."/>
        <enum value="2"   name="XR_SPATIAL_REFERENCE_IMAGE_FORMAT_RGB_888_EXT"     comment="An RGB buffer. The format makes no guarantees regarding the layout of the pixel data in memory. The pixels must: be accessed using the metadata provided by the corresponding slink:XrSpatialReferenceImagePlaneEXT structures. Each pixel color channel has an 8 bit size, making each pixel 24 bit in size."/>
        <enum value="3"   name="XR_SPATIAL_REFERENCE_IMAGE_FORMAT_YUV_420_888_EXT" comment="A YUV buffer that is 4:2:0 pattern chroma sub-sampled. The format makes no guarantees regarding the layout of the pixel data in memory. The pixels must: be accessed using the metadata provided by the corresponding slink:XrSpatialReferenceImagePlaneEXT structures. Each decoded RGB pixel color channel has an 8 bit size, making each pixel 24 bit in size."/>
    </enums>
